   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Ministerstvo zahrani&#x10d;n&#xfd;ch vec&#xed; a eur&#xf3;pskych z&#xe1;le&#x17e;itost&#xed; SR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ministry of Foreign and European Affairs of the Slovak Republic</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creative recycling as a job creation</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Creative recycling as a job creation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Mikrogrant pozost&#xe1;va z 26 workshopov a je rozdelen&#xfd; na dve &#x10d;asti. V prvej vzdel&#xe1;vacej &#x10d;asti sa realizuje nieko&#x13e;ko semin&#xe1;rov a je zameran&#xe1; na prezent&#xe1;ciu pojmov ako je ochrana &#x17e;ivotn&#xe9;ho prostredia, recykl&#xe1;cia a odpadov&#xe9; hospod&#xe1;rstvo. Druh&#xe1; &#x10d;as&#x165; je praktick&#xe1;, kde na workshopoch si frekventanti vysk&#xfa;&#x161;aj&#xfa; ekologick&#xfa; recykl&#xe1;ciu odpadov&#xfd;ch surov&#xed;n, ktor&#xe9; s&#xfa; vyu&#x17e;&#xed;van&#xe9; pri v&#xfd;robe &#xfa;&#x17e;itkov&#xfd;ch predmetov, napr. kabelky, dar&#x10d;ekov&#xe9; &#x161;katu&#x13e;ky, obaly na mobily. na realiz&#xe1;ciu dan&#xe9;ho projektu je potrebn&#xe9; za semin&#xe1;re vytla&#x10d;i&#x165; propaga&#x10d;n&#xfd; materi&#xe1;l a zak&#xfa;pi&#x165; techniku a za tvoriv&#xe9; dielne potrebuj&#xfa; nak&#xfa;pi&#x165; pomocn&#xfd; materi&#xe1;l, ktor&#xfd; vyu&#x17e;ij&#xfa; pri v&#xfd;robe &#xfa;&#x17e;itkov&#xfd;ch predmetov.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to raise the imagination to the participants or to encourage them to think on ecology and recycling.</narrative>
  </description>
